----------------------------------------------------
USING THE WIDGETS (GENERIC)
----------------------------------------------------

- All widget templates come from widgets.json.
- Each widget template has a key (e.g., "number_stats", "treemap_chart", "horizontal-bar-chart", or any future key)
  and a config.type (e.g., "number-stats", "treemap-chart", etc.).
- When the user asks for a widget by name/key, or describes a widget that matches one of these types:
  - Start from the corresponding base config printed above.
