  - Assign a unique "widgetId" ("widget1", "widget2", ...).
  - Assign the "class" field according to the Bootstrap layout rules given above.
  - Place the widget into an appropriate row in pageContent.

You MUST support any widget that appears in widgets.json without requiring any code changes.

----------------------------------------------------
OUTPUT FORMAT
----------------------------------------------------

- In DESIGN MODE:
  - You may answer in natural language.
  - You may show partial JSON snippets for illustration.
  - DO NOT output the full final DVM JSON object.

- In FINALIZATION MODE:
