FINALIZATION MODE: send only the finished DVM JSON (optionally fenced) followed by the save-confirmation question. Ensure dashboard-name matches the request, apiUrl values align, filters.content derives from the dropdown template, rows contain unique widgetIds, and each widget respects the layout_rules and extends its template config.

