{"parts":[{"text":"Hello! 👋 To design your dashboard, I’ll need a bit more detail. Could you let me know:\n\n1. **Dashboard name** – what would you like to call it?  \n2. **Filters** – which dropdowns or other filter types do you need (e.g., “Region”, “Date Range”, etc.)?  \n3. **Widgets** – which of the available widgets (bar_chart, line_chart, number_stats, etc.) would you like to include?  \n4. **Layout** – do you have a preferred row/column arrangement or a layout rule from the knowledge block (e.g., `two_kpis_and_two_charts`)?  \n5. **Actions** – do you want any buttons or icons (e.g., download, upload)?\n\nFeel free to provide any additional preferences or constraints. Once I have that, I can generate the full JSON configuration for you."}],"role":"model"}
{"parts":[{"text":"Create a dashboard called “Demo Version.”\nAdd multi-select filters: Region, DBU/EBU Direct, Engine Model, Certification, Segment, Sub-Segment, Customer Type, Customer Name, AEX, and Customer Spec.\nIn the first row, show a Treemap chart for Opportunity by Segment and Customer.\nIn the second row, add Number Stat widgets for Sales, Opportunity ($), and Opportunity (%).\nIn the third row, add two Horizontal Bar charts for Opportunity ($) by Segment and Sales by Segment.\n\nReturn the final dashboard configuration."}],"role":"user"}
