{"parts":[{"text":"Generate the final dashboard configuration for a dashboard named \"Demo Version\".\n\nFilters:\nInclude the following filters — Region, DBU/EBU Direct, Engine Model, Certification, Segment, Sub-Segment, Customer Type, Customer Name, AEX, and Customer Spec.\nAll filters should support multi-selection.\n\nWidgets Configuration:\n\nRow 1, Widget 1: Treemap Chart — Opportunity by Segment and Customer\nRow 2, Widgets 2 (3-5): Three Number-Stat KPIs — Sales Opportunity ($), Opportunity ($), Opportunity (%)\nRow 3, Widgets 6-7: Two Horizontal Bar Charts — Opportunity ($) by Segment and Sales by Segment\nReturn only the final dashboard configuration."}],"role":"user"}
