{"parts":[{"text":"I need a few details to build the dashboard exactly as you want:\n\n1. **Filter configuration**  \n   * What are the API URLs for fetching the options for each global filter (Region, DBU/EBU Direct, Engine‑Model, Certification, Segment, Sub‑Segment, Customer Type, Customer Name, AEX, Customer Spec, Financial Year, Pricing Strategy)?  \n   * What should the `key` and `name` be for each filter? (e.g., `region`, `dbu_ebu_direct`, `engine_model`, …)  \n   * Should all of them be multi‑select and query‑param enabled?  \n   * Should the first option be selected by default?  \n\n2. **Treemap widget**  \n   * Confirm the filter key for the treemap (`application_id`?) and that it should broadcast filter events to widgets `widget6` and `widget7`.  \n\n3. **Number‑stats widgets**  \n   * What data keys/series should each KPI use?  \n   * Which of the KPIs need a `$` prefix?  \n   * Should they listen to widgets `widget1`, `widget6`, and `widget7`?  \n\n4. **Horizontal‑bar‑chart widgets**  \n   * What filter keys should they use (e.g., `application_id`, `engine_model_1`)?  \n   * What series, xAxis, yAxis, and tooltip labels are expected?  \n   * Should they listen to each other via `engine_model_1`?  \n\n5. **Layout**  \n   * Do you want the left and right columns to each occupy 6 Bootstrap columns (i.e., `col-6` on medium+ screens)?  \n\nOnce I have these answers, I can generate the full JSON configuration for the “Opportunity Overview” dashboard."}],"role":"model"}
