{"parts":[{"text":"Hello! 👋 To design your dashboard, I’ll need a few details:\n\n1. **Dashboard name** – What would you like to call it?  \n2. **Filters** – Which dropdowns or other filter types do you need? (e.g., “Region”, “Product Category”)  \n3. **Widgets** – Which visual components would you like to include? (e.g., bar chart, line chart, number stats, table, etc.)  \n4. **Layout** – How many rows/columns, and any preferred arrangement?  \n5. **Actions** – Do you want any buttons or icons (e.g., download, upload)?\n\nFeel free to give as much or as little detail as you’d like, and I’ll fill in the rest!"}],"role":"model"}
{"parts":[{"text":"Generate the final dashboard configuration for a dashboard named \"Opportunity Overview\".\nFilters:\nInclude the following filters — Region, DBU/EBU Direct, Engine Model, Certification, Segment, Sub-Segment, Customer Type, Customer Name, AEX, Customer Spec, Financial Year and Pricing Strategy\nAll filters should support multi-selection.\nWidgets Configuration:\nColumn 1, Row 1, Widget 1: Treemap Chart — Opportunity by Segment and Customer\nColumn 2, Row 2, Widgets 3,4 and 5: Three Number-Stat KPIs — Engine System Sales(2024), Opportunity($), Opportunity(%)\nColumn 2, Row 3, Widgets 6 and 7: Two Horizontal Bar Charts — Opportunity($) and Sales\nReturn only the final dashboard configuration."}],"role":"user"}
{"parts":[{"text":"```json\n{\n  \"dashboard-name\": \"Opportunity Overview\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"apiUrl\": \"\",\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"region\",\n        \"name\": \"Region\",\n        \"options\": \"region\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"dbu_ebu_direct\",\n        \"name\": \"DBU/EBU Direct\",\n        \"options\": \"dbu_ebu_direct\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"engine_model\",\n        \"name\": \"Engine Model\",\n        \"options\": \"engine_model\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"certification\",\n        \"name\": \"Certification\",\n        \"options\": \"certification\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"segment\",\n        \"name\": \"Segment\",\n        \"options\": \"segment\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"sub_segment\",\n        \"name\": \"Sub-Segment\",\n        \"options\": \"sub_segment\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"customer_type\",\n        \"name\": \"Customer Type\",\n        \"options\": \"customer_type\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"customer_name\",\n        \"name\": \"Customer Name\",\n        \"options\": \"customer_name\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"aex\",\n        \"name\": \"AEX\",\n        \"options\": \"aex\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"customer_spec\",\n        \"name\": \"Customer Spec\",\n        \"options\": \"customer_spec\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"financial_year\",\n        \"name\": \"Financial Year\",\n        \"options\": \"financial_year\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"dropdown\",\n        \"key\": \"pricing_strategy\",\n        \"name\": \"Pricing Strategy\",\n        \"options\": \"pricing_strategy\",\n        \"isMultiSelect\": true,\n        \"isQueryParam\": false,\n        \"isfirstOptionDefault\": true\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"pageContent\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"row1\",\n      \"columns\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"col1\",\n          \"widgets\": [\n            {\n              \"apiUrl\": \"/api/v1/highway/grouped-dropdown\",\n              \"class\": \"col-12 col-md-10 col-sm-12 col-lg-6\",\n              \"filterKey\": [\n                \"application_id\"\n              ],\n              \"filterListner\": [\n                \"auto\"\n              ],\n              \"series\": \"data\",\n              \"title\": \"Opportunity by Segment and Customer\",\n              \"tooltipLabels\": {\n                \"child\": \"Customer Name\",\n                \"parent\": \"Segment\",\n                \"sales\": \"Current Sales $\",\n                \"value\": \"Opportunity $\"\n              },\n              \"triggerFilterEvent\": true,\n              \"type\": \"treemap-chart\",\n              \"useCommaStat\": true,\n              \"useQueryParams\": true,\n              \"widgetId\": \"widget1\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"col2\",\n          \"widgets\": []\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"row2\",\n      \"columns\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"col1\",\n          \"widgets\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"col2\",\n          \"widgets\": [\n            {\n              \"apiUrl\": \"/api/v1/highway/financial-summary\",\n              \"bgColor\": \"rgb(240, 240, 240)\",\n              \"class\": \"col-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-lg-6\",\n              \"key\": \"engine_system_sales_2024\",\n              \"parentKey\": \"engine_system_sales_2024\",\n              \"prefix\": \"$\",\n              \"title\": \"Engine System Sales(2024)\",\n              \"type\": \"number-stats\",\n              \"useFormatStat\": true,\n              \"useQueryParams\": true,\n              \"value\": \"data\",\n              \"widgetId\": \"widget2\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"apiUrl\": \"/api/v1/highway/financial-summary\",\n              \"bgColor\": \"rgb(240, 240, 240)\",\n              \"class\": \"col-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 col-lg-6\",\n              \"key\": \"opportunity_amount\",\n              \"parentKey\": \"opportunity_amount\",\n              \"prefix\": \"$\",\n              \"title\": \"Opportunity($)\",\n              \"type\": \"number-stats\",\n              \"useFormatStat\": true,\n              \"useQueryParams\": true,\n              \"value\": \"data\",\n              \"widgetId\": \"widget3\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"apiUrl\":